14. Common Mistakes
==================

❌ Forgetting the base case in recursive templates.

--------------------------------------

❌ Confusing

typename... Args

with

Args... args

The first declares the template parameter pack.

The second declares the function parameter pack.

--------------------------------------

❌ Forgetting to expand the parameter pack.

Incorrect

print(args);

Correct

print(args...);

--------------------------------------

❌ Using recursion in C++17 when a fold expression is simpler.

